          {
            "text": "My phone number starts with 0.",
            "note": "التعرّف على الرقم 0"
          },
          {
            "text": "The price is 9 dollars.",
            "note": "قراءة الرقم 9"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "heading": "استخدم الأرقام في جمل بسيطة",
        "body": "- How many? – Two.\n- I need five tickets.\n- There are ten students.",
